      },
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "P =\n\\begin{bmatrix}\n\\dfrac{n}{r} & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\[10pt]\n0 & \\dfrac{n}{t} & 0 & 0 \\\\[10pt]\n0 & 0 & A & B \\\\[10pt]\n0 & 0 & -1 & 0\n\\end{bmatrix}",
