        "ariaLabel": "\\begin{bmatrix} x_{\\text{clip}} \\\\[6pt] y_{\\text{clip}} \\\\[6pt] z_{\\text{clip}} \\\\[6pt] w_{\\text{clip}} \\end{bmatrix} = P \\begin{bmatrix} 1 \\\\[6pt] 2 \\\\[6pt] -3 \\\\[6pt] 1 \\end{bmatrix}"
