      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "\\begin{bmatrix}\nx_{\\text{clip}} \\\\[6pt]\ny_{\\text{clip}} \\\\[6pt]\nz_{\\text{clip}} \\\\[6pt]\nw_{\\text{clip}}\n\\end{bmatrix}\n=\nP\n\\begin{bmatrix}\n1 \\\\[6pt]\n2 \\\\[6pt]\n-3 \\\\[6pt]\n1\n\\end{bmatrix}",
