      "originalText": "Barrier",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 91,
      "versionNonce": 411544305,
      "index": "bDd",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "BReX443GmETnb50aGv_1t",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 9036.061195865266,
      "y": 1615.076819794311,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "width": 671.5839785319495,
      "height": 40,
      "seed": 1339817599,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791553521593,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "是一种同步机制,如果前面的步骤刚写完数据，后面的步骤马上要去读，GPU \n默认是不会自动帮他们排队或刷新缓存",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "是一种同步机制,如果前面的步骤刚写完数据，后面的步骤马上要去读，GPU 默认是不会自动帮他们排队或刷新缓存",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 113,
      "versionNonce": 1788155199,
      "index": "bDe",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "v4J4_iEiORI8KryExWsjr",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 9035.32524819364,
      "y": 1685.0359431302843,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "width": 680.0115375164296,
      "height": 40,
      "seed": 115172959,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791553341012,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "如果第 1 步计算着色器刚往 SSBO 写入了顶点数据\n第 2 步立刻用 glDrawElements 去绘制这些顶点，第 2 步大概率会读到旧数据或者全 0",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果第 1 步计算着色器刚往 SSBO 写入了顶点数据\n第 2 步立刻用 glDrawElements 去绘制这些顶点，第 2 步大概率会读到旧数据或者全 0",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 50,
      "versionNonce": 2061969887,
      "index": "bDf",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "4Ry0-Z3FsVh940YbvJnai",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 9167.902551113899,
      "y": 1557.545255442819,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "width": 153,
      "height": 20,
      "seed": 1417248273,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791553339029,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "glMemoryBarrier()",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "glMemoryBarrier()",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 89,
      "versionNonce": 919259903,
      "index": "bDh",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "7LV5DBs-On6V8Fl9gdxFo",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 9067.121687867402,
      "y": 1807.153299720671,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "width": 672,
      "height": 100,
      "seed": 1654267839,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791553527691,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "// 1. CPU 上更新数据\nglBufferData(GL_ARRAY_BUFFER, sizeof(vertices), vertices, GL_DYNAMIC_DRAW);\n\n// 2. 紧接着直接绘制\nglDrawArrays(GL_TRIANGLES, 0, 3);",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "// 1. CPU 上更新数据\nglBufferData(GL_ARRAY_BUFFER, sizeof(vertices), vertices, GL_DYNAMIC_DRAW);\n\n// 2. 紧接着直接绘制\nglDrawArrays(GL_TRIANGLES, 0, 3);",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 96,
      "versionNonce": 588586207,
