      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "// 间接绘制命令结构体 (对齐 GPU 硬件数据格式)\nstruct DrawElementsIndirectCommand {\n    uint32_t count;         // 绘制索引数\n    uint32_t instanceCount; // 实例数\n    uint32_t firstIndex;    // 索引偏移\n    int32_t  baseVertex;    // 顶点偏移\n    uint32_t baseInstance;  // 实例起始 ID\n};\n\n// 创建 Buffer 并仅分配空间（不填充初始绘制命令，交给 GPU 生成）\nGLuint indirectBuffer;\nglGenBuffers(1, &indirectBuffer);\nglBindBuffer(GL_DRAW_INDIRECT_BUFFER, indirectBuffer);\nglBufferData(GL_DRAW_INDIRECT_BUFFER, 30000 * sizeof(DrawElementsIndirectCommand), NULL, GL_DYNAMIC_DRAW);",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "// 间接绘制命令结构体 (对齐 GPU 硬件数据格式)\nstruct DrawElementsIndirectCommand {\n    uint32_t count;         // 绘制索引数\n    uint32_t instanceCount; // 实例数\n    uint32_t firstIndex;    // 索引偏移\n    int32_t  baseVertex;    // 顶点偏移\n    uint32_t baseInstance;  // 实例起始 ID\n};\n\n// 创建 Buffer 并仅分配空间（不填充初始绘制命令，交给 GPU 生成）\nGLuint indirectBuffer;\nglGenBuffers(1, &indirectBuffer);\nglBindBuffer(GL_DRAW_INDIRECT_BUFFER, indirectBuffer);\nglBufferData(GL_DRAW_INDIRECT_BUFFER, 30000 * sizeof(DrawElementsIndirectCommand), NULL, GL_DYNAMIC_DRAW);",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
