      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "vec3 vReflection = reflect(-vLightDir, vEyeNormal);\nfloat EyeReflectionAngle = max(0.0, dot(vEyeNormal, vReflection));\nfSpec = pow(EyeReflectionAngle, shininess);\nvec3 vSpecularColor = vSpecularLight * vSpecularMaterial * fSpec;",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "vec3 vReflection = reflect(-vLightDir, vEyeNormal);\nfloat EyeReflectionAngle = max(0.0, dot(vEyeNormal, vReflection));\nfSpec = pow(EyeReflectionAngle, shininess);\nvec3 vSpecularColor = vSpecularLight * vSpecularMaterial * fSpec;",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
