      "updated": 1794038533970,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "颜色取决于你的感受器怎么响应，而不是光的\"真实颜色\"（性质）",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "颜色取决于你的感受器怎么响应，而不是光的\"真实颜色\"（性质）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dZxTNM8b0ihQ9-VePKjTH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3237.4547107675808,
      "y": 5998.84737658418,
      "width": 386,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fab005",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 155983897,
      "version": 91,
      "versionNonce": 399092215,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794038153333,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "苹果是\"红\"的是大脑给出的标签，而不是光本身的性质",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "苹果是\"红\"的是大脑给出的标签，而不是光本身的性质",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JM27hHkFNTEKXP0QLJiZ9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3235.2193167892383,
      "y": 6040.7906133505885,
      "width": 432,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#fab005",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 380637977,
      "version": 208,
      "versionNonce": 849638297,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794038393416,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "视网膜上有三种视锥细胞，分别对长、中、短波长的光敏感。\n它们把光信号转成神经信号，传给大脑。\n大脑综合这些信号，生成\"红色\"这种主观体验。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "视网膜上有三种视锥细胞，分别对长、中、短波长的光敏感。\n它们把光信号转成神经信号，传给大脑。\n大脑综合这些信号，生成\"红色\"这种主观体验。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5hN1n10bAg9qBlFtNVNXP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3466.5669732055894,
      "y": 5810.114077061531,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fab005",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
