      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "描述一束光在每个波长上携带多少能量，本质上是一个函数 S(λ)，横轴是波长",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
