      "seed": 439855351,
      "version": 133,
      "versionNonce": 348915543,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794038400919,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "著名的\"裙子颜色\"事件（蓝黑还是白金）\n，同一张照片，不同人的大脑对光照的推\n断不同，看到了不同的颜色",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "afkw7rG-XFEEkm2YmfUe-",
      "originalText": "著名的\"裙子颜色\"事件（蓝黑还是白金），同一张照片，不同人的大脑对光照的推断不同，看到了不同的颜色",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zpzpCTM_Shkl9Ncd8zllm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3723.1888407167485,
      "y": 6136.041028563848,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1560774521,
      "version": 115,
      "versionNonce": 1261369177,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "tXeNj6V5SSwvoSoZeS6Lt",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1794038436353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "正是因为不同人的视锥细胞数量比例不同！！！",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "正是因为不同人的视锥细胞数量比例不同！！！",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
